WEBVTT

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.720
but Nigeria and other countries
are a very long way back.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.336
So how are we doing on this target?

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:07.536
What progress are we going to make
over the next 12 years

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.520
based on the current direction of travel?

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.696
Well, here we go ...

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.496
and yes, there is some progress.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.216
Our top four countries
are all hitting the SDG targets --

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.456
some are moving forward quite quickly.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:21.856
But it's not enough
to really move us forward significantly.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:24.136
What we see is that
for the world as a whole,

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:29.576
we're forecasting a score
of around 85, 86 by 2030 --

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.800
not fast enough.